    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Loan Calculator</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Loan Calculator</h1>\n    <form id=\"loan-form\">\n      <div class=\"field\">\n        <label for=\"amount\">Loan Amount ($)</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"amount\" name=\"amount\" min=\"0\" step=\"any\" inputmode=\"decimal\" required>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"field\">\n        <label for=\"rate\">Annual Interest Rate (%)</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"rate\" name=\"rate\" min=\"0\" step=\"any\" inputmode=\"decimal\" required>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"field\">\n        <label for=\"years\">Term (Years)</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"years\" name=\"years\" min=\"0\" step=\"any\" inputmode=\"decimal\" required>\n      </div>\n      <button type=\"submit\">Calculate</button>\n    </form>\n    <section id=\"results\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n      <div class=\"result-item\">\n        <span class=\"label\">Monthly Payment:</span>\n        <span id=\"monthly-payment\" class=\"value\">$0.00</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"result-item\">\n        <span class=\"label\">Total Paid:</span>\n        <span id=\"total-paid\" class=\"value\">$0.00</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"result-item\">\n        <span class=\"label\">Total Interest:</span>\n        <span id=\"total-interest\" class=\"value\">$0.00</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #2b2b3c;\n  --card-bg: #3c3c5a;\n  --text: #f0f0f0;\n  --accent: #ffcc00;\n  --accent-hover: #ffe066;\n  --border: #5a5a7a;\n  --input-bg: #2b2b3c;\n  --input-border: #5a5a7a;\n  --input-focus: #ffcc00;\n  --radius: 0px;\n  --pixel: 2px;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card-bg);\n  border: var(--pixel) solid var(--border);\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--border);\n  padding: 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 420px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #000;\n}\n\n.field {\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n}\n\ninput {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  color: var(--text);\n  background: var(--input-bg);\n  border: var(--pixel) solid var(--input-border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  outline: none;\n  transition: border-color 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;\n}\n\ninput:hover {\n  border-color: var(--accent-hover);\n}\n\ninput:focus-visible {\n  border-color: var(--input-focus);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--accent);\n}\n\ninput:active {\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n}\n\nbutton {\n  display: block;\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 12px;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  color: #1a1a2e;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  border: var(--pixel) solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.1s;\n  margin-top: 8px;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: var(--accent-hover);\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 2px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n  box-shadow: none;\n}\n\n#results {\n  margin-top: 24px;\n  border-top: var(--pixel) solid var(--border);\n  padding-top: 16px;\n}\n\n.result-item {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  padding: 8px 0;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n}\n\n.result-item .label {\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.result-item .value {\n  font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 16px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 1.3rem;\n  }\n  .result-item {\n    font-size: 1rem;\n  }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "app.js",
      "content": "document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {\n  const form = document.getElementById('loan-form');\n  const amountInput = document.getElementById('amount');\n  const rateInput = document.getElementById('rate');\n  const yearsInput = document.getElementById('years');\n  const monthlyPaymentEl = document.getElementById('monthly-payment');\n  const totalPaidEl = document.getElementById('total-paid');\n  const totalInterestEl = document.getElementById('total-interest');\n\n  function formatCurrency(value) {\n    return '$' + value.toFixed(2);\n  }\n\n  function calculate() {\n    const amount = parseFloat(amountInput.value);\n    const annualRate = parseFloat(rateInput.value);\n    const years = parseFloat(yearsInput.value);\n\n    if (isNaN(amount) || isNaN(annualRate) || isNaN(years) || amount < 0 || annualRate < 0 || years <= 0) {\n      monthlyPaymentEl.textContent = '$0.00';\n      totalPaidEl.textContent = '$0.00';\n      totalInterestEl.textContent = '$0.00';\n      return;\n    }\n\n    const monthlyRate = annualRate / 100 / 12;\n    const totalPayments = years * 12;\n    let monthlyPayment;\n\n    if (monthlyRate === 0) {\n      monthlyPayment = amount / totalPayments;\n    } else {\n      const factor = Math.pow(1 + monthlyRate, totalPayments);\n      monthlyPayment = amount * monthlyRate * factor / (factor - 1);\n    }\n\n    const totalPaid = monthlyPayment * totalPayments;\n    const totalInterest = totalPaid - amount;\n\n    monthlyPaymentEl.textContent = formatCurrency(monthlyPayment);\n    totalPaidEl.textContent = formatCurrency(totalPaid);\n    totalInterestEl.textContent = formatCurrency(totalInterest);\n  }\n\n  form.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    calculate();\n  });\n\n  [amountInput, rateInput, yearsInput].forEach(function (input) {\n    input.addEventListener('input', calculate);\n  });\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Loan Calculator\n\nA simple, offline loan calculator with a pixel-art style. Enter loan amount, annual interest rate, and term in years to see monthly payment, total paid, and total interest.\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. No server or internet connection required.\n\n- Inputs: Loan Amount ($), Annual Interest Rate (%), Term (Years).\n- Results update automatically as you type or when you press Calculate.\n- All values are rounded to two decimal places.\n\n## Formula\n\nMonthly payment is calculated using the standard amortization formula:\n\n- If annual rate is 0%: `monthlyPayment = amount / (years * 12)`\n- Otherwise: `monthlyPayment = amount * r * (1+r)^n / ((1+r)^n - 1)` where `r = annualRate / 100 / 12` and `n = years * 12`.\n\nTotal paid = monthlyPayment × n. Total interest = total paid − amount.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – main page structure\n- `styles.css` – pixel-themed styling\n- `app.js` – calculation logic and event handling\n\n## Accessibility\n\nAll inputs are labeled and keyboard-accessible. Results are announced via an aria-live region. Focus states are visible.\n\n## Responsiveness\n\nThe layout works on screens as narrow as 360px.",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
